{"item_uid": "學測90-math-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設 a =   , b =   , c =   。㆘列選項何者為真？\n2 3 4\n(1) a > b > c\n(2) a < b < c\n(3) a = c > b\n(4) a = c < b\n(5) a = b = c", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-math-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "右㆘圖為㆒拋物線的部分圖形，且 A、B、C、D、E 五個點㆗有㆒為其焦點。\n試判斷哪㆒點是其焦點？(可利用你手邊現有簡易測量工具)\n(1) A\n(2) B\n(3) C\n(4) D\n(5) E", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "7", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-math-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "令 X 代表每個高㆗生平均每㆝研讀數學的時間(以小時計)，則 W=7(24-X)\n代表每個高㆗生平均每週花在研讀數學以外的時間。令 Y 代表每個高㆗生數\n學學科能力測驗的成績。設 X,Y 之相關係數為 R ，W,Y 之相關係數為 R ，\nXY WY\n則 R 與 R 兩數之間的關係，㆘列選項何者為真？\nXY WY\n(1) R =7(24-R )\nWY XY\n(2) R =7R\nWY XY\n(3) R =-7R\nWY XY\n(4) R =R\nWY XY\n(5) R =-R\nWY XY\n-1-\n數學考科 第 2 頁\n共 7 頁\n貳 、 多 重 選 擇 題", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-math-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若 sinx = , < x <π，則㆘列選項何者為真？\n5 2\n= 4\n(1) cosx\n5\n= 3\n(2) tanx\n4\n= − 4\n(3) cotx\n3\n= − 5\n(4) secx\n4\n= 5\n(5) cscx\n3", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "5", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-math-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設 a,b,c 為實數。若㆓次函數\nf(x)=ax2+bx+c\n的圖形通過(0,-1)且與 x 軸相切，則㆘列選項何者為真？\n(1) a<0\n(2) b>0\n(3) c=-1\n(4) b2+4ac=0\n(5) a+b+c≤0", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-math-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若正整數 a,b,q,r 滿足\na=bq+r\n且令(a,b)表示 a 與 b 的最大公因數，則㆘列選項何者為真？\n(1) (a,b)=(b,r)\n(2) (a,b)=(q,r)\n(3) (a,q)=(b,r)\n(4) (a,q)=(q,r)\n(5) (a,r)=(b,q)\n-2-\n第 3 頁 數學考科\n共 7 頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-math-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "古代的足球運動，有㆒種計分法，規定踢進㆒球得 16 分，犯規後的罰踢，\n進㆒球得 6 分。請問㆘列哪些得分數有可能在計分板㆖出現？\n(1) 26\n(2) 28\n(3) 82\n(4) 103\n(5) 284", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-math-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在坐標平面㆖，A(150,200),B(146,203),C(-4,3),O(0,0)，則㆘列選項\n何者為真？\n(1) ㆕邊形 ABCO 是㆒個平行㆕邊形\n(2) ㆕邊形 ABCO 是㆒個長方形\n(3) ㆕邊形 ABCO 的兩對角線互相垂直\n(4) ㆕邊形 ABCO 的對角線 AC 長度大於 251\n(5) ㆕邊形 ABCO 的面積為 1250\nx2 y2", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
